  "title": "I was recently gifted a @Lomi | Home Composter ! They asked me to try...",
  "description": "I was recently gifted a @Lomi | Home Composter ! They asked me to try it out and tell you what I think (unpaid. No conditions, which is very cool IMO.)  So what did I think? Ultimately, I love it. Its cute, easy to use, quiet, reduces the food scraps I have to send to the landfill, and helps my garden. I will use this even more in the winter when my worms are hibernating. Downsides? It’s pricy ($349), but so are many many things I like and have, or want but can’t afford. So it goes, especially with new technology.  I could see someone being less motivated to use this if you don’t have a garden, however it’s still beneficial for the planet to dehydrate food scraps before they hit the landfill. If the cost doesn’t deter you, and you care about individual action to help climate change OR if you have a garden, I bet you’ll love the Lomi.  Thank you Lomi for sending me one, I will definitely be using this very often. 💗🥕 #gifted #honestreview #nofoodwaste #compost #lomi ",
